data: {"id": "4b208167ddd74fcf-final", "run_id": "4b208167ddd74fcf", "seq": 854, "ts_ms": 1789148425027, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod `workload` 的容器配置引用了 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中的 key `unavailable-key`，但该 ConfigMap 中实际不存在此 key，导致 kubelet 挂载环境变量失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\" | 确认容器因配置错误无法启动 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `event.message`: Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input | 直接定位缺失资源的具体路径与属性 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input | 提供与 Event 一致的错误详情 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`=1 (label: reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\", container=\"app\") | 外部指标验证了容器的等待状态与原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase`=1 (label: phase=\"Pending\") | 确认 Pod 整体处于 Pending 阶段，未进入运行态 |\n\n**证据小结**：\nKubernetes 的 Event 与 Container State 提供了完全一致的文本证据（#2, #3），指出 `workload` Pod 因无法挂载 `aiops-case-11/workload-input` ConfigMap 中的 `unavailable-key` 而失败。Prometheus 指标 (#4, #5) 在数值上同步反映了这一状态，佐证了 Pod 处于 `Pending` 且容器处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 等待中。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 配置遗漏 key → 环境变量挂载失败 → 容器启动失败 (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因：`workload` Pod 的容器配置引用了 ConfigMap `aiops-case-11/workload-input` 中并不存在的 key `unavailable-key`。\n**支撑证据**：\n- `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态及具体失败信息来自事实 #2, #3。\n- 该错误直接导致容器无法初始化，表现为事实 #1, #4, #5 中的状态指标。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 38.9s (Evidence 31.5s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.217, "metrics": {"run_id": "4b208167ddd74fcf", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.22410488128662, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62224.10488128662, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 59000.38838386536, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7493.945121765137, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2925.9753227233887}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15877.14958190918, "success"